Here's the fix in pseudocode, translated to C++ syntax:
```cpp
int fact(int n) {
    // Base case: if n is 0 or 1, return 1
    if (n <= 1) {
        return 1;
    }
    // Recursive case: return n multiplied by the fact of (n-1)
    else {
        return n * fact(n - 1);
    }
}
```
